=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,1,14)\">Exod 1:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; both || <bdbheb>לְבֵנִים</bdbheb>); <ref ref=\"Nah 3:14\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,14)\">Nah 3:14</ref> (|| <bdbheb>טיט</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>clay:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> as material of vessels <ref ref=\"Jer 18:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,4)\">Jer 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 18:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,6)\">Jer 18:6</ref>, <bdbheb>היצר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 29:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,16)\">Isa 29:16</ref>, in simile of God's fashioning man <ref ref=\"Isa 45:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,9)\">Isa 45:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 64:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,64,7)\">Isa 64:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 10:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,9)\">Job 10:9</ref> as material of human bodies <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בָּתֵּי ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 4:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,19)\">Job 4:19</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Job 33:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,6)\">Job 33:6</ref> as material of bulwarks (disparagingly) <ref ref=\"Job 13:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,12)\">Job 13:12</ref> <bdbheb>חותם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> = <highlight>seal-clay</highlight> i.e. clay upon which seal is pressed. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> = <highlight>mire</highlight> <bdbheb>חוצות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</